```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student / Faculty Evaluator
    participant UI as React Dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (/api/score)
    participant Srv as NoveltyService
    participant XAI as NoveltyExplainer
    participant TFIDF as TF-IDF Extractor
    participant Dense as Dense Extractor
    participant DB as SQLite Storage

    User->>UI: Input 8 text sections & select scoring mode (e.g. Tuned Hybrid)
    User->>UI: Clicks "Evaluate Novelty"
    UI->>API: POST /api/score?mode=tuned_hybrid
    API->>Srv: score_proposal(candidate_dict, mode="tuned_hybrid")
    Srv->>Srv: Resolve alpha=0.60 from phase5_tuned_hybrid_config.json
    Srv->>XAI: explain_proposal(candidate, top_k=5, alpha=0.60)

    par Lexical Section Similarities
        XAI->>TFIDF: compute_candidate_similarity(candidate)
        TFIDF-->>XAI: 8 section cosine similarities against 600 corpus projects
    and Semantic Section Similarities
        XAI->>Dense: encode candidate sections & compute dot product
        Dense-->>XAI: 8 section semantic cosine similarities against 600 corpus projects
    end

    XAI->>XAI: Convex Combination: s_i = 0.60 * s_i^lex + 0.40 * s_i^sem
    XAI->>XAI: Predicted Similarity = sum(w_i * s_i) with Candidate Weights
    XAI->>XAI: Check self-exclusion (exclude matching project_id if provided)
    XAI->>XAI: Deterministic Sort: top 5 matches
    XAI->>XAI: Overall Novelty % = (1 - max_similarity / 4.0) * 100%
    XAI->>XAI: Extract shared n-grams & keyword context snippets

    XAI-->>Srv: Complete XAI Evaluation Report
    Srv-->>API: Enriched Response with Section Difference Summaries
    API-->>UI: HTTP 200 OK (JSON payload)
    UI->>User: Renders Radial Gauge, Section Overlap Charts, Top Matches, Model Badges

    opt Save Proposal
        User->>UI: Clicks "Save Proposal"
        UI->>API: POST /api/save (candidate payload + verified report)
        API->>DB: Verify title match, check duplicates, insert proposal & report
        DB-->>API: Assigned project_id (e.g. SUB-0002)
        API-->>UI: HTTP 201 Created
        UI->>User: Confirmation pill & link to view in submission history
    end
```
